# Regression guard — this file must NEVER be loaded.
#
# AddOn snippets are included by exact name only:
#   AddOn/<domain>/<site>.preconfig   and   AddOn/<domain>/<site>.postconfig
# Older macros used the glob <site>.pre* / <site>.post*, which also pulled in
# backups such as "<site>.preconfig.bak-2026..." and silently applied stale rules.
#
# The directive below is invalid on purpose: if a glob include ever comes back,
# "apache2ctl configtest" fails and tests/run-tests.sh step [1b] reports it.
ThisAddOnBackupMustNeverBeLoaded
